<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">I have exciting news to share! The American Red Cross
thinks an incredible gift deserves a gift in return.</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;"> </span><b style="font-size: 12pt;">I am excited to
announce the new <a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.redcrossblood.org%2Fdonate-blood%2Fblood-donor-rewards.html%3F%2524web_only%3Dtrue%26%25243p%3De_adobe_campaign_classic%26_branch_match_id%3D826522012477291994%26utm_medium%3DEmail%2520Adobe%2520Campaign%2520Classic%26_branch_referrer%3DH4sIAAAAAAAAA1WMwQrDIBBEv8beYiCml0IohdLfkFWXRLpxZTVI%252F742t8LAMG%252FgbbXmchtHweCFS3HEHDTkrCmm92jyXU2zyQtaCOzQetgzxDVZT1BK9Jd%252Bs8Q1JiB7CC3bT6jMQ02vntaa%252FlezrJ0HTlBxOFGfZw8dsgyCDSQUvdWdlOmS6zQ3dJYTfZR5VjnwC8HYD7u1AAAA&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctiffany.gradel%40redcross.org%7C21c5be5e664c465436c808dc15d97d33%7Cdd5b5d42c0d34ad2b5f160edb3af2771%7C0%7C0%7C638409271099112722%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=2j4radf8hOlvgA8H9I6916dTUzspGlBWIlfPipX6w0I%3D&amp;reserved=0">Blood
Donor Rewards program</a> - made to celebrate your donors and the generous
contributions they make to help patients in need.</b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">When donors come to donate at your next blood drive, they’ll
earn points that can be redeemed for exclusive rewards. For each blood
donation, they’ll earn at least 100 points, up to six times within a 365-day
period. That's at least 600 points!<span class="MsoHyperlinkFollowed"><sup><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:windowtext"> </span></sup></span><span class="eventlinksfooter"><sup><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">1
</span></sup></span>&nbsp;Donors can even earn more points by trying Power
Reds, if available at your blood drive. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>Giving is Rewarding. </b>Points can be redeemed for
e-gift cards that can be redeemed at any time, or they can be saved for one Red
Cross item to be redeemed when the store is open for a few weeks in January
2025.<span class="eventlinksfooter"><sup><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">1</span></sup></span><span class="eventlinksfooter"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"> </span></span>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/donate-blood/blood-donor-rewards.html">Find
out more! </a><span class="MsoHyperlink"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b>Share this exciting opportunity with your donors</b> <b>or
if you are a donor take advantage yourself!&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></b></p>

<br><p class="MsoNormal"><p class="MsoNormal">P.S. Have a drive coming up? Be sure to share this great new
opportunity with friends, family and co-workers to help fill your blood drive
schedule! <o:p></o:p></p><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
